Z||000013||thomas_l||10-01-2001||09:06 AM||||That's the risk of racing a daily driver. The upside is you got lucky and didn't break anything. I have found that racing will break things you never thought you would. OF course I didn't go into details when I exchanged a 5 month old leaky rear brake caliper with 1500 <I>really</I> hard miles on it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
